{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set discoverCandidates = ttm_get_discover_child_paternity_candidates(npc.UUID) %}

{% if discoverCandidates != "" %}Available children about whom paternity truth is discovered/learned: {{discoverCandidates}}{% endif %}

USE WHEN {{speakingNpc.name}} learns, discovers, or finds out the truth about a child's (born or unborn/pregnancy) true biological parentage (e.g. noticing undeniable physical differences or trait resemblances in a born child, hearing confessions, hearing rumors, observing interactions, or confronting the situation and realizing the truth).
- If {{speakingNpc.name}} is the partner / presumed father: realizes or confirms that a child (or unborn pregnancy) was fathered by another man and that he is NOT the biological father.
- If {{speakingNpc.name}} is the biological father: realizes or confirms that he IS the true biological father of the child (or unborn baby).
- Specify the exact child name (or unborn child description) and mother when multiple children exist.
NEVER use if {{speakingNpc.name}} has not learned or uncovered new truth regarding a child's paternity.
